        "Name": "RespawnButtonText",
        "Type": "string",
        "Default": "Waiting...",
        "Source": {
          "Kind": "Manual"
        },
        "Description": "Label of the primary action. Bound OneWay to RespawnButton.ButtonText. Controller flips between \"Waiting (Ns)...\" and \"RESPAWN\" each tick — this is the single-variable swap that avoids needing a second \"Waiting\" button or IsDisabled binding.",
